      "id": "flow-note",
      "x": 0,
      "y": -300,
      "w": 700,
      "page": "page-1",
      "text": "Desktop, 1440 x 900. The controls work: the rail jumps back to any screen you have answered, the interest grid filters as you type, the name arrives already filled in with a Shuffle beside it, and Continue stays dead until the screen is answered.\n\nEvery screen pinned open is on the second page, from the pages menu in the toolbar."
    },
    {
      "id": "gap-note",
      "x": 780,
      "y": -300,
      "w": 660,
      "page": "page-1",
      "text": "Deliberately absent: no free-text interest, and no name list for \"indigenous\". The server collects a name, up to three traits, up to three interests, a starting state, an attraction and eight appearance answers. Every list here is the server's, checked against it."
    },
    {
      "id": "pronoun-note",
      "x": 1580,
      "y": 3240,
      "w": 700,
      "page": "page-2",
      "text": "The top row carries the point. Screen two is shown twice, once for each answer to screen one: the copy and the sample silhouette both follow it, and neither exists before the question is asked."
    }
